WEBVTT

00:00:01.120 --> 00:00:04.230
STAFF ROOM

00:00:01.620 --> 00:00:03.620
A meeting of delegates?

00:00:03.620 --> 00:00:07.350
Apparently there's been such an
influx of clubs since Spring,

00:00:07.350 --> 00:00:09.720
we've run out of club rooms.

00:00:09.830 --> 00:00:10.610
Oh.

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:14.380
Is this the outbreak of Wizard War VI
for basal supremacy?!

00:00:14.380 --> 00:00:15.590
How exciting!

00:00:15.590 --> 00:00:18.050
Silence! And...?

00:00:18.790 --> 00:00:21.400
And the student council
is gathering all of the

00:00:21.400 --> 00:00:24.080
clubs  to hold a one-time briefing session.

00:00:24.080 --> 00:00:26.430
They want your club to be in attendance.

00:00:26.810 --> 00:00:29.350
Is the purpose of that meeting to take away

00:00:29.350 --> 00:00:31.380
rooms from clubs deemed inactive?

00:00:31.520 --> 00:00:33.380
I doubt it.

00:00:33.380 --> 00:00:34.220
I'm sure of it.

00:00:34.440 --> 00:00:37.030
The meeting is being held today after school,

00:00:37.030 --> 00:00:38.570
so make sure your delegate attends.

00:00:38.570 --> 00:00:40.700
Are you the club's delegate, Togashi?

00:00:40.700 --> 00:00:41.430
No.

00:00:41.680 --> 00:00:43.100
Isn't it you, Rikka?

00:02:14.980 --> 00:02:17.820
CLUB
DELEGATES
MEETING

00:02:15.540 --> 00:02:17.820
This is the Sabbath hall.

00:02:17.820 --> 00:02:19.540
The universal decision-making body!

00:02:19.540 --> 00:02:22.620
Is this where world-wide trends are created?

00:02:25.590 --> 00:02:27.830
They all look so intimidating.

00:02:28.260 --> 00:02:32.070
That's because each club is desperate
to secure a club room.

00:02:33.350 --> 00:02:34.760
Can you do this, Rikka?

00:02:37.050 --> 00:02:39.550
CLUB
DELEGATES
MEETING

00:02:37.400 --> 00:02:38.230
Dekomori.

00:02:38.230 --> 00:02:39.550
Yes, Master?

00:02:39.550 --> 00:02:46.100
CLUB
DELEGATES
MEETING

00:02:39.770 --> 00:02:41.710
From this day forward
starting now, Dekomori...

00:02:41.710 --> 00:02:45.630
...I transfer leadership of the
Far-East Magical Society to you.

00:02:45.630 --> 00:02:46.610
What?

00:02:48.030 --> 00:02:49.640
It's a napping society!

00:02:49.740 --> 00:02:51.620
I am a being of the Dark.

00:02:51.930 --> 00:02:54.270
It is terribly perilous for one such as I
to appear

00:02:54.270 --> 00:02:55.690
in such an overt gathering.

00:02:56.250 --> 00:02:57.040
You don't wanna do it.

00:02:57.040 --> 00:02:59.880
Yuta, if I should appear in such a meeting,

00:02:59.880 --> 00:03:02.120
the overwhelming power of Wicked Lord Shingan

00:03:02.120 --> 00:03:05.280
will inevitably affect every mortal in my vicinity.

00:03:05.280 --> 00:03:08.120
So you're saying you don't wanna do it.

00:03:11.220 --> 00:03:11.970
Hey.

00:03:11.970 --> 00:03:13.010
Excuse me.

00:03:13.640 --> 00:03:15.590
The meeting is starting.

00:03:18.550 --> 00:03:22.600
Maybe you should have gone in
with her, Togashi.

00:03:22.600 --> 00:03:24.400
There's no way I could do that.

00:03:24.400 --> 00:03:26.600
Only one delegate from each club can attend.

00:03:26.740 --> 00:03:29.060
Master, you are a shining example
of a Dark Being!

00:03:29.060 --> 00:03:30.910
Just look at your all-enveloping
deep black aura!

00:03:30.910 --> 00:03:33.410
No one can touch you now!

00:03:33.410 --> 00:03:34.560
She's just nervous.

00:03:34.870 --> 00:03:37.310
I call the delegate from the
Far-East Magical Napping...?

00:03:37.310 --> 00:03:38.460
Society...

00:03:38.460 --> 00:03:40.130
...summer thereof.

00:03:40.130 --> 00:03:42.400
That is I. I am here.

00:03:43.000 --> 00:03:45.710
Sure. Please describe your club activities.

00:03:45.710 --> 00:03:48.970
Unfortunately I am not at
liberty to discuss that.

00:03:49.300 --> 00:03:51.760
Those who have chosen to learn of our society

00:03:51.760 --> 00:03:55.260
have done so in full acceptance
of the risks to life and limb...

00:03:55.810 --> 00:03:58.090
...but with the guidance
of the fallen angels...

00:04:04.650 --> 00:04:06.860
So you did write a speech for her.

00:04:06.860 --> 00:04:09.260
Yes, because we can't let her do the talking.

00:04:11.360 --> 00:04:14.530
We, the "Far-East Magical Napping Society
- summer thereof"...

00:04:14.530 --> 00:04:15.600
...mumble, mumble.

00:04:16.980 --> 00:04:17.980
Such commoners!

00:04:18.330 --> 00:04:19.880
Those weaker beings were awed speechless

00:04:19.880 --> 00:04:21.570
in the presence of Wicked
Lord Shingan. Victory!

00:04:21.570 --> 00:04:25.300
My master! Your dark aura is
a force to be reckoned with!

00:04:25.590 --> 00:04:30.410
So she was removed from the room
without saying anything helpful?

00:04:30.410 --> 00:04:33.410
It's more like she removed herself.

00:04:33.510 --> 00:04:35.590
Based on the historical materials
of magic and such...

00:04:35.590 --> 00:04:38.260
...we explore the cultural
value and uses of...

00:04:35.590 --> 00:04:38.260
Can you please speak up?

00:04:42.810 --> 00:04:43.860
I feel ill.

00:04:43.860 --> 00:04:44.470
What?

00:04:44.560 --> 00:04:45.480
See?

00:04:45.480 --> 00:04:48.570
Why didn't you go in there with her?

00:04:48.570 --> 00:04:51.930
Because only one person
from a club could attend.

00:04:51.930 --> 00:04:55.600
That is exactly the time to use
the fact that you're a couple.

00:04:55.600 --> 00:04:56.350
For example...

00:04:57.120 --> 00:05:00.110
Rikka and I are of one flesh!
Only together are we one person!

00:05:00.580 --> 00:05:03.990
No one must ever...

00:05:04.210 --> 00:05:05.240
...come between us!

00:05:06.380 --> 00:05:08.120
That would be too embarrassing.

00:05:08.340 --> 00:05:12.040
But you two are inseparable. Right?

00:05:12.510 --> 00:05:15.010
Yeah, you're such lovebirds.

00:05:15.010 --> 00:05:16.210
In what way?!

00:05:16.680 --> 00:05:18.840
We really would be
ejected if we did that.

00:05:20.980 --> 00:05:22.460
Good afternoon!

00:05:22.710 --> 00:05:23.530
Teacher.

00:05:24.020 --> 00:05:26.080
What brings you here?

00:05:26.310 --> 00:05:27.930
A special news bulletin!

00:05:28.530 --> 00:05:29.600
The student council?

00:05:29.780 --> 00:05:33.170
Uh-huh. The gist was that you don't
appear to be active enough...

00:05:33.170 --> 00:05:35.120
...to merit the use of a club room.

00:05:35.120 --> 00:05:37.100
They asked me for my opinion as your advisor.

00:05:37.410 --> 00:05:40.290
Well, that's no big surprise.

00:05:41.070 --> 00:05:42.960
Hey! Give that back!

00:05:42.960 --> 00:05:44.440
So what came of it?

00:05:45.490 --> 00:05:48.250
I told them that I would confirm
your club's activities

00:05:48.250 --> 00:05:50.190
and make a one-time report.

00:05:50.190 --> 00:05:53.810
So, what do you guys do in here?

00:05:55.510 --> 00:05:56.720
You don't know?

00:05:56.720 --> 00:05:57.410
Uh-huh.

00:05:57.760 --> 00:05:59.540
You are our advisor, right?

00:05:59.760 --> 00:06:01.430
That's just it.

00:06:01.430 --> 00:06:04.000
The student council person
asked me the same thing.

00:06:04.000 --> 00:06:05.100
Oh.

00:06:05.100 --> 00:06:07.520
But you have a magic summoning circle,

00:06:07.520 --> 00:06:09.700
so I'm sure you do magic-type things.

00:06:11.610 --> 00:06:13.030
Let go of that!

00:06:13.030 --> 00:06:14.860
Mjolnir Tornado!

00:06:14.860 --> 00:06:16.180
Or not.

00:06:16.280 --> 00:06:17.290
True.

00:06:17.740 --> 00:06:19.400
But I nap.

00:06:20.080 --> 00:06:20.950
You're awake?

00:06:20.950 --> 00:06:21.790
Yeah.

00:06:21.790 --> 00:06:22.830
Nap?

00:06:22.830 --> 00:06:25.210
Yes. It's even in the name, see?

00:06:25.210 --> 00:06:27.080
"The Napping Society - summer thereof."

00:06:27.080 --> 00:06:30.170
You're right. Does that mean
you're also a napping club?

00:06:30.170 --> 00:06:31.210
Yes.

00:06:31.210 --> 00:06:33.910
I doubt that classifying our magical society

00:06:33.910 --> 00:06:35.620
as a napping society will help our case much.

00:06:35.800 --> 00:06:37.490
You're wrong.

00:06:37.420 --> 00:06:39.750
Napping Competition
(search)

00:06:37.490 --> 00:06:39.750
Napping clubs are perfectly acceptable.

00:06:40.580 --> 00:06:42.250
10 Ways to Win a Napping Tournament
The Napping Olympics Expo

00:06:40.720 --> 00:06:42.840
There is such a thing
as championship napping?

00:06:42.840 --> 00:06:47.340
Yes. In Europe, they even hold tournaments
as a competitive sport.

00:06:45.590 --> 00:06:47.340
Registering Now
For This Year's Participants

00:06:47.650 --> 00:06:50.610
How do you determine the merits of a nap?

00:06:50.610 --> 00:06:53.350
Well, the total score is based on...

00:06:53.350 --> 00:06:55.740
...speed of repose, sleep posture,
slumber depth...

00:06:55.740 --> 00:06:59.060
...and time to achieve wakefulness.

00:06:59.060 --> 00:07:00.640
You knew about this, Kumin-senpai?

00:07:00.870 --> 00:07:03.570
Yes, because I am involved in nap studies.

00:07:03.570 --> 00:07:05.250
Anyway, I happen to be acquainted

00:07:05.250 --> 00:07:07.240
with a teacher at a school that has

00:07:07.240 --> 00:07:09.360
what they call the Siesta Appreciation Club.

00:07:09.360 --> 00:07:10.490
Siesta?

00:07:11.340 --> 00:07:12.460
Magic?

00:07:12.460 --> 00:07:16.450
Exactly, Master! It means "nap" in Spanish.

00:07:16.720 --> 00:07:19.540
So, for example, if we
were to actively enter an

00:07:19.540 --> 00:07:21.370
intramural competition with that school...

00:07:21.560 --> 00:07:23.580
The council would be forced
to accept our club.

00:07:24.060 --> 00:07:25.000
That's right!

00:07:25.960 --> 00:07:33.680
To:      Momijigaoka High
School Siesta Club Advisor

00:07:26.140 --> 00:07:30.440
Would you like me to send an email
asking the other school to compete?

00:07:30.440 --> 00:07:33.680
Yes, please! Or at least I'd like to...

00:07:33.900 --> 00:07:38.200
...but Kumin-senpai is the only one
among us who actually naps.

00:07:38.200 --> 00:07:40.410
We can't jump straight into a competition.

00:07:40.820 --> 00:07:43.830
Don't worry. It's not really that hard.

00:07:43.830 --> 00:07:45.150
I'll show you how to do it.

00:07:45.450 --> 00:07:46.580
You will?

00:07:46.790 --> 00:07:49.110
Sure! Just leave it to me.

00:07:49.460 --> 00:07:51.210
Darkness comes.

00:07:51.210 --> 00:07:52.240
Yes!

00:07:52.340 --> 00:07:54.470
Watch out for the trains!

00:07:54.750 --> 00:07:58.580
I had no idea that napping was so profound.

00:07:58.840 --> 00:08:03.170
It sure is. It's very difficult
to achieve an elegant nap.

00:08:03.430 --> 00:08:06.910
The top, most active performers
achieve such elegant naps...

00:08:06.910 --> 00:08:08.610
...it's emotionally moving.

00:08:08.940 --> 00:08:09.800
Is that so?

00:08:10.350 --> 00:08:14.940
Yes. Their posture and the
comfortable look on their faces...

00:08:15.190 --> 00:08:16.890
The indescribably delicate depth of sleep...

00:08:16.890 --> 00:08:19.470
...as they enter deep slumber.

00:08:20.070 --> 00:08:22.200
Why, they look just like...

00:08:26.450 --> 00:08:27.390
She's asleep!

00:08:28.910 --> 00:08:33.190
After all we've heard, she's actually
starting to look impressive.

00:08:33.190 --> 00:08:34.150
Yeah.

00:08:34.590 --> 00:08:35.490
Excuse me?

00:08:36.710 --> 00:08:37.840
Yes?

00:08:37.840 --> 00:08:43.230
Are you the members of
Icho High's napping club?

00:08:43.230 --> 00:08:45.250
We are actually.

00:08:45.810 --> 00:08:51.770
I am Nemuri Sui and I represent Momijigaoka
High's Siesta Association...

00:08:48.650 --> 00:08:52.130
President, Siesta Association:
Sui Nemuri

00:08:52.270 --> 00:08:54.260
What? The Siesta Association?

00:08:54.440 --> 00:08:58.280
What is this sleepy aura emanating
from her every pore?

00:08:58.280 --> 00:09:00.510
She is drowsiness personified!

00:09:06.910 --> 00:09:09.870
No, Master! You'll be sucked in!

00:09:10.440 --> 00:09:11.360
Dekomori!

00:09:11.620 --> 00:09:14.650
My advisor passed along
a rare invitation to compete...

00:09:14.650 --> 00:09:18.050
...so I thought I should
introduce myself in person.

00:09:18.050 --> 00:09:19.330
Thank you taking the time.

00:09:19.670 --> 00:09:20.240
However...

00:09:20.510 --> 00:09:21.250
However?

00:09:21.590 --> 00:09:23.770
It appears it was unnecessary.

00:09:23.970 --> 00:09:24.640
What?

00:09:25.300 --> 00:09:27.000
From what I can determine,

00:09:27.000 --> 00:09:30.130
you do not appear to be
seriously involved in napping.

00:09:30.350 --> 00:09:33.810
I can only presume that you use your club
as an excuse to goof around.

00:09:33.810 --> 00:09:34.920
She knows!

00:09:35.150 --> 00:09:37.030
Do not worry.

00:09:37.030 --> 00:09:42.470
Almost every club that claims
to be a nap club are like yours.

00:09:42.650 --> 00:09:45.990
However, our Siesta Association is different.

00:09:45.990 --> 00:09:48.480
We take napping very seriously.

00:09:48.830 --> 00:09:52.810
Please refrain from making such
invitations for amusement.

00:09:53.460 --> 00:09:55.100
I-I'm sorry.

00:09:55.750 --> 00:09:57.090
Understood.

00:09:57.740 --> 00:10:01.460
The competition is called off.
Please notify your advisor.

00:10:02.050 --> 00:10:04.500
It is not for amusement.

00:10:06.050 --> 00:10:07.330
Nor are we goofing around.

00:10:07.680 --> 00:10:08.810
Kumin-senpai?

00:10:09.180 --> 00:10:11.770
The Far-East Magical Napping Society
- summer thereof...

00:10:11.770 --> 00:10:13.960
...always takes its activities seriously.

00:10:14.350 --> 00:10:15.590
Isn't that right, guys?

00:10:15.690 --> 00:10:17.860
Huh? Well, um...

00:10:18.400 --> 00:10:19.500
Togashi!

00:10:21.350 --> 00:10:22.080
Dekomori!

00:10:22.900 --> 00:10:23.850
M-Master!

00:10:24.110 --> 00:10:25.210
What? Um...

00:10:25.740 --> 00:10:28.020
Uh, that's right!

00:10:28.580 --> 00:10:31.120
Really? In that case...

00:10:31.120 --> 00:10:34.570
May I accept this as an actual challenge?

00:10:34.830 --> 00:10:35.990
Of course.

00:10:36.120 --> 00:10:39.380
I swear on the Wicked Lord Shingan
that I always fight for keeps.

00:10:39.380 --> 00:10:40.960
Failure equals death!

00:10:40.960 --> 00:10:42.700
You're on fire, Master!

00:10:42.840 --> 00:10:46.720
If we should happen to lose this battle,
at that very moment...

00:10:47.470 --> 00:10:49.010
...I will disband our society!

00:10:49.680 --> 00:10:51.960
What?!

00:10:59.970 --> 00:11:01.650
How stupid are you?!

00:11:01.650 --> 00:11:05.090
You have to learn to stop being so haphazard!

00:11:05.570 --> 00:11:09.000
Battle is always waiting to pounce unbidden.

00:11:09.910 --> 00:11:11.100
It's ready.

00:11:11.830 --> 00:11:15.290
This is an official playing field?

00:11:15.290 --> 00:11:18.630
Yes. Sanctioned by the Japanese high
school napping federation.

00:11:18.630 --> 00:11:20.520
The professional version is a little bigger.

00:11:20.520 --> 00:11:21.030
Professional?!

00:11:23.300 --> 00:11:26.420
Team competitions are fought
with five people to a team.

00:11:26.420 --> 00:11:28.700
Points are awarded for the speed of falling

00:11:28.700 --> 00:11:31.040
asleep and for artistic merit and posture.

00:11:31.470 --> 00:11:33.000
It's surprisingly complex.

00:11:33.220 --> 00:11:34.960
Now let's give it a try!

00:11:35.100 --> 00:11:37.520
Don't worry about posture for now.

00:11:37.520 --> 00:11:39.470
Think only about sleeping.

00:11:39.650 --> 00:11:41.980
I have Theatre Club to go to.

00:11:41.980 --> 00:11:45.620
The moment you leave,
our club is as good as disbanded.

00:11:46.860 --> 00:11:48.640
Oh, fine.

00:11:51.320 --> 00:11:54.830
It's not all that easy to fall asleep.

00:11:54.830 --> 00:11:57.030
Start by closing your eyes.

00:12:05.920 --> 00:12:08.310
Is that Takanashi I hear?

00:12:08.310 --> 00:12:10.050
Oh, Yuta.

00:12:10.050 --> 00:12:11.930
What on Earth is she doing?

00:12:13.850 --> 00:12:14.850
Yuta...

00:12:14.850 --> 00:12:15.750
No way!

00:12:19.460 --> 00:12:20.560
What are you doing?

00:12:21.020 --> 00:12:24.830
You're wrong! I was just, uh...

00:12:24.830 --> 00:12:26.020
Yuta...

00:12:27.070 --> 00:12:29.470
I can't move.

00:12:29.470 --> 00:12:30.570
She's sleep paralyzed!

00:12:30.570 --> 00:12:31.920
Of course she is.

00:12:31.920 --> 00:12:34.450
Master's mind is free of
the wicked and indecent

00:12:34.450 --> 00:12:36.800
thoughts experienced by the likes of you.

00:12:36.800 --> 00:12:38.750
I never said anything.

00:12:38.750 --> 00:12:41.070
And what do you mean by indecent?

00:12:41.210 --> 00:12:42.960
I meant...

00:12:42.960 --> 00:12:44.450
Early bloomer.

00:12:44.630 --> 00:12:47.410
What?! You be quiet, Fake Summer!

00:12:47.830 --> 00:12:49.340
Knock that off!

00:12:49.340 --> 00:12:49.970
Shut up!

00:12:49.970 --> 00:12:52.830
Come on. Sleep properly.

00:12:53.180 --> 00:12:55.310
Next, we will nap outdoors.

00:12:55.310 --> 00:12:58.090
The ability to sleep the
same, despite a change

00:12:58.090 --> 00:13:00.590
of environment, is a vital napping skill.

00:13:01.060 --> 00:13:02.310
Here?

00:13:02.310 --> 00:13:03.770
We have to sleep here?

00:13:03.770 --> 00:13:07.390
Master! The light! The
Light Being is attacking!

00:13:08.200 --> 00:13:10.340
Schwarz Shield Prototype...

00:13:10.340 --> 00:13:12.520
...Mark IV!

00:13:14.620 --> 00:13:15.850
Now let's swim!

00:13:16.120 --> 00:13:17.490
Right now?!

00:13:17.490 --> 00:13:22.150
Yes, because comfortable fatigue
is the best method to induce a good nap.

00:13:22.540 --> 00:13:25.900
But why the pool? It's
still too cold to swim.

00:13:26.340 --> 00:13:30.410
You're right. That's a shame.
Swimming really is the best way.

00:13:30.410 --> 00:13:33.300
Because swimming helps you "crawl" into bed!

00:13:33.300 --> 00:13:34.200
It was a pun?

00:13:34.300 --> 00:13:35.910
Hey, come over here!

00:13:36.970 --> 00:13:40.430
Is that Isshiki? What's he doing?

00:13:40.770 --> 00:13:43.960
He probably followed Kumin-senpai to the pool

00:13:43.960 --> 00:13:47.340
to show off to her that he can nap too.

00:13:49.070 --> 00:13:50.030
Let's go.

00:13:50.030 --> 00:13:50.890
Yeah.

00:13:52.280 --> 00:13:53.640
Kumin-senpai.

00:13:55.620 --> 00:13:58.110
Naps are a lot harder than I thought.

00:13:58.870 --> 00:14:01.500
Because it's hard to ready, set, nap.

00:14:02.410 --> 00:14:05.040
Don't worry. Wicked Lord
Shingan is all powerful.

00:14:05.870 --> 00:14:07.360
That's my master!

00:14:07.420 --> 00:14:11.030
Is now really the time for that?
If we lose, the club is gone.

00:14:11.210 --> 00:14:13.090
We just need to win.

00:14:14.680 --> 00:14:15.370
Win, Yuta!

00:14:15.370 --> 00:14:16.030
Who, me?

00:14:16.030 --> 00:14:18.120
Don't worry. I know we can do it.

00:14:18.390 --> 00:14:20.650
Where does that unwavering
confidence come from?

00:14:24.230 --> 00:14:25.650
Dekomori, nice timing!

00:14:25.650 --> 00:14:26.400
Yes!

00:14:26.400 --> 00:14:28.010
What are you rigging up now?!

00:14:28.270 --> 00:14:30.480
Are we really going to make it like this?

00:14:30.480 --> 00:14:33.360
Shouldn't we work out some sort of strategy?

00:14:33.360 --> 00:14:36.110
What strategy could there be
in a sleeping competition?

00:14:36.110 --> 00:14:38.850
Aside for learning how to sleep faster.

00:14:38.950 --> 00:14:42.740
That's it! There is a simple way to do it!

00:14:43.710 --> 00:14:46.170
The Night Before the
Competition

00:14:44.000 --> 00:14:46.190
I will fight at your side...

00:14:46.440 --> 00:14:48.430
...until the darkness vanishes with the dawn!

00:14:48.710 --> 00:14:49.990
Naturally!

00:14:50.250 --> 00:14:53.430
We just have to stay up all night...

00:14:53.430 --> 00:14:55.580
...and we'll definitely be sleepy
in time for the competition.

00:14:55.720 --> 00:14:56.760
I get it.

00:14:56.760 --> 00:14:59.420
Although it isn't the most elegant
napping method.

00:14:59.760 --> 00:15:03.400
We can't control our actions
after we're asleep...

00:15:03.770 --> 00:15:06.270
...so it's more important to
start with falling asleep faster.

00:15:06.270 --> 00:15:07.550
That's true.

00:15:07.850 --> 00:15:09.170
Well, enjoy yourselves.

00:15:09.650 --> 00:15:10.150
Right.

00:15:10.150 --> 00:15:11.260
Good night!

00:15:11.610 --> 00:15:14.100
But why? Why does this always happen?

00:15:14.100 --> 00:15:15.870
Fork them over, Very Poor Man!

00:15:17.160 --> 00:15:20.460
Take this! The Parallel
Pin Bone King explosion!

00:15:20.460 --> 00:15:23.530
No! Not my fish paste factory!

00:15:24.830 --> 00:15:26.500
50 combo!

00:15:27.830 --> 00:15:29.110
Go! Go!

00:15:29.110 --> 00:15:31.710
For I am...

00:15:31.710 --> 00:15:35.470
...a sparkling monochrome monster.

00:15:42.390 --> 00:15:43.890
Yuta.

00:15:43.890 --> 00:15:45.430
Hero.

00:15:54.890 --> 00:15:56.820
WHAT THE HECK?!

00:15:59.160 --> 00:16:00.730
Morning, Hero.

00:16:02.830 --> 00:16:04.370
Togashi, what did you do?

00:16:04.370 --> 00:16:04.950
Huh?

00:16:04.950 --> 00:16:07.710
Has the Dark Flame Master
turned to the dark side?

00:16:07.710 --> 00:16:08.540
No!

00:16:09.530 --> 00:16:12.490
So sorry. Old habits die hard.

00:16:12.960 --> 00:16:14.520
I forgot that Hero and the Wicked Lord

00:16:14.520 --> 00:16:17.030
Shingan are bound by the Lover's Contract.

00:16:17.340 --> 00:16:18.930
I believe this is yours.

00:16:20.450 --> 00:16:21.750
WHAT THE HECK?

00:16:23.100 --> 00:16:24.200
Later!

00:16:24.710 --> 00:16:26.100
Hey, wait.

00:16:26.100 --> 00:16:27.600
She left.

00:16:28.140 --> 00:16:30.440
Throw down salt! I need salt, Kuzuha!

00:16:30.440 --> 00:16:34.010
But weren't all of you
supposed to stay awake?

00:16:35.390 --> 00:16:37.630
Oh, no!

00:16:37.990 --> 00:16:41.220
I failed! This was the
magical devil girl's plot all along!

00:16:41.220 --> 00:16:44.340
No, it's our fault for falling asleep!

00:16:44.740 --> 00:16:45.900
Hurry!

00:16:46.950 --> 00:16:49.540
We will now commence the practice match...

00:16:49.540 --> 00:16:53.160
...between Icho High's Far-East Magical
Napping Society - summer thereof...

00:16:53.160 --> 00:16:56.420
...versus Momijioka High Siesta Association.

00:16:56.840 --> 00:16:58.720
Hold on here.

00:16:56.850 --> 00:16:58.160
Advance Guard: Fujiko Nasutaka

00:16:58.350 --> 00:16:59.660
Second Guard: Barumu Ichiba

00:16:58.880 --> 00:17:02.620
I don't think we have a hope in hell!

00:16:59.850 --> 00:17:01.160
Center: Youko Tenbaku

00:17:01.350 --> 00:17:02.620
Second in Command: Toromi Utsutsutouge

00:17:04.400 --> 00:17:07.600
It's impossible to determine
if they're even awake at this very moment!

00:17:07.600 --> 00:17:10.290
They are definitely dwellers
of the Dream World.

00:17:10.810 --> 00:17:11.590
Danger.

00:17:11.850 --> 00:17:15.360
As promised, you will disband if you lose.

00:17:15.860 --> 00:17:18.620
I would be happy to obliterate...

00:17:18.990 --> 00:17:21.430
...even one more farcical napping club.

00:17:22.280 --> 00:17:23.910
What now?

00:17:23.910 --> 00:17:26.080
There's no way we can win this.

00:17:26.080 --> 00:17:28.940
We all got so much sleep,
our skin looks fabulous.

00:17:27.500 --> 00:17:28.930
Advance Guard: Rikka Takanashi
Second guard: Sanae Dekomori

00:17:29.080 --> 00:17:31.000
We have only one option left.

00:17:29.920 --> 00:17:31.390
Center: Yuta Togashi

00:17:31.620 --> 00:17:34.040
If we apologize to them now, just maybe...

00:17:32.630 --> 00:17:34.780
Second in Command: Shinka Nibutani

00:17:34.040 --> 00:17:34.780
You can't!

00:17:35.340 --> 00:17:38.440
Captain: Kumin Tsuyuri

00:17:35.630 --> 00:17:40.070
We will not lose.
Our club is not that irresponsible.

00:17:40.070 --> 00:17:41.160
Kumin-senpai.

00:17:41.510 --> 00:17:44.970
I remember thinking it
when I met Rikka for the first time.

00:17:45.930 --> 00:17:47.510
Oh, really?

00:17:47.510 --> 00:17:48.670
Precisely.

00:17:49.130 --> 00:17:53.550
Our true goal is to locate
the invisible boundary line.

00:17:53.940 --> 00:17:56.760
But our actions will not end there.

00:17:57.400 --> 00:18:00.260
For that is our society!

00:18:02.150 --> 00:18:03.990
I had a feeling back then...

00:18:04.340 --> 00:18:09.560
...that things really could work out
if I joined her and her friends.

00:18:09.840 --> 00:18:12.980
With her? But she has chunibyo.

00:18:13.250 --> 00:18:15.660
Yes. But you know?

00:18:15.660 --> 00:18:18.230
And I know nobody
really gets this about her...

00:18:18.230 --> 00:18:19.900
...but she's very wholehearted and

00:18:19.900 --> 00:18:21.900
serious about what she does...

00:18:22.270 --> 00:18:23.990
...just like a napping club.

00:18:24.840 --> 00:18:25.750
Kumin.

00:18:25.970 --> 00:18:28.350
In our Far-East Magical Napping Society
- summer thereof...

00:18:28.350 --> 00:18:30.360
...we nap hard,

00:18:30.890 --> 00:18:32.680
we play hard...

00:18:33.140 --> 00:18:35.760
...and we banish hard,

00:18:36.240 --> 00:18:37.750
so we cannot lose.

00:18:39.190 --> 00:18:40.550
We're invincible!

00:18:42.820 --> 00:18:43.910
Yeah!

00:18:44.260 --> 00:18:45.270
Be destroyed, real.

00:18:45.270 --> 00:18:46.390
Blow up, synapses.

00:18:46.390 --> 00:18:48.350
Banishment, This World!

00:19:01.250 --> 00:19:03.790
This world of sleep belongs to us.

00:19:04.630 --> 00:19:06.370
Leave here at once!

00:19:06.470 --> 00:19:09.340
Avalon Smasher!

00:19:13.230 --> 00:19:15.170
Mjolnir Hammer!

00:19:22.850 --> 00:19:23.720
Disqualified!

00:19:25.570 --> 00:19:28.100
I am the Dark Flame Master.

00:19:28.250 --> 00:19:30.190
Be enveloped in the flames of darkness...

00:19:31.150 --> 00:19:32.100
Disqualified!

00:19:34.870 --> 00:19:36.580
Why does it always have to be me?!

00:19:38.120 --> 00:19:40.000
I got a cramp in my leg!

00:19:40.000 --> 00:19:40.860
Disqualified!

00:19:43.510 --> 00:19:44.970
Who's left?

00:19:44.970 --> 00:19:46.490
Just those two.

00:19:46.760 --> 00:19:50.950
The Non-REM killer technique:
Circadian Rhythm Destroyer!

00:19:47.470 --> 00:19:52.190
The Non-REM Killer Technique:
Circadian Rhythm Destroyer

00:19:52.850 --> 00:19:54.380
Destiny Ring!

00:19:52.900 --> 00:19:55.410
Destiny Ring

00:19:57.770 --> 00:19:58.710
But why?

00:19:59.090 --> 00:20:01.440
You could take that incredible power

00:20:01.440 --> 00:20:04.300
and aim for the world title if you were serious!

00:20:04.780 --> 00:20:08.140
The truth is, I like that place.

00:20:10.660 --> 00:20:11.770
What is this?

00:20:17.410 --> 00:20:20.280
That is why I must protect it.

00:20:21.380 --> 00:20:22.860
Sleeper's Wake.

00:20:34.640 --> 00:20:37.370
Kumin-senpai. Kumin-senpai.

00:20:42.520 --> 00:20:44.770
Togashi, you're all here.

00:20:44.770 --> 00:20:47.400
We did it. We won.

00:20:47.400 --> 00:20:48.890
Kumin, I am grateful.

00:20:49.950 --> 00:20:51.850
Really? What happened to Sui and her friends?

00:20:52.490 --> 00:20:55.020
They went home. They said they accept defeat.

00:20:55.330 --> 00:20:57.580
That means we don't have to disband.

00:20:57.580 --> 00:20:58.790
But of course!

00:20:58.790 --> 00:21:01.150
I will battle Fake Summer
once again tomorrow!

00:21:01.150 --> 00:21:02.670
Why is that?!

00:21:05.460 --> 00:21:06.490
What?

00:21:06.760 --> 00:21:09.630
I had a funny dream while I was sleeping.

00:21:10.010 --> 00:21:11.130
What kind of dream?

00:21:11.640 --> 00:21:13.300
I was with all of you, and...

00:21:14.260 --> 00:21:16.500
Was that really a dream?

00:21:19.350 --> 00:21:21.460
I unleash this power.

00:21:23.650 --> 00:21:25.170
Lightning Blast!

00:21:27.900 --> 00:21:30.900
With this, the attributing
thunder technique is flawless.

00:21:30.900 --> 00:21:33.480
I'll do it! Count me in!

00:21:33.640 --> 00:21:36.310
Freshman, you messed with my costume again!

00:21:35.330 --> 00:21:36.300
FAKE

00:21:36.490 --> 00:21:38.230
There you are, Fake Summer!

00:21:40.080 --> 00:21:41.330
It's very versatile.

00:21:41.330 --> 00:21:42.960
Stay out of it!

00:21:42.960 --> 00:21:44.540
Do not look away!

00:21:44.920 --> 00:21:49.610
Ultimately nothing changed.
We still don't nap at all.

00:21:49.610 --> 00:21:54.260
Yeah, but I'm happiest when I sleep here.

00:21:54.260 --> 00:21:56.050
So, good night.

00:21:56.050 --> 00:21:57.350
One more shot!

00:21:57.350 --> 00:21:58.890
Yuta, watch out!

00:22:00.060 --> 00:22:00.980
What was that for?!

00:22:00.980 --> 00:22:02.390
Dekomori, sound the lightning!

00:22:02.300 --> 00:22:05.680
To Be
Continued

00:22:02.390 --> 00:22:03.520
Roger that!

00:22:03.520 --> 00:22:05.970
Listen to me!
